<title>ITALY: CYCLING-TIRRENO-ADRIATICO TIME TRIAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-TIRRENO-ADRIATICO TIME TRIAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SORRENTO, Italy 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in the</p>
<p>opening four km individual time trial of the Tirreno-Adriatico</p>
<p>cycle race on Wednesday (Italian unless stated):</p>
<p> 1. Rolf Sorensen (Denmark) 4 minutes 38.93 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Erik Dekker (Netherlands)	 1 second behind</p>
<p> 3. Maurizio Fondriest		  2</p>
<p> 4. Gabriele Colombo		    3</p>
<p> 5. Leon Van Bon (Netherlands)	</p>
<p> 6. Gianluca Pianegonda		 both same time</p>
<p> 7. Frank Corvers (Belgium)	   4</p>
<p> 8. Roberto Petito			</p>
<p> 9. Paolo Savoldelli		    both same time</p>
<p> 10.Michele Bartoli		     5</p>
</text>
